ion to prevent new pod scheduling", "passed": true}, {"check": "Ensure renice/kill actions are logged and communicated to the application team if the process maps to a business-critical deployment", "passed": true}, {"check": "Validate kubelet health and node Ready status after load subsides; check for CPU throttling metrics in cgroupfs", "passed": true}], "incidentTitle": "CPU Spike Alert (>95% Utilization) on WorkerNode1HL (192.168.100.102)", "confidenceScore": 85, "rejectionReason": "Rejected by operator bulk command", "proposedCommands": ["ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"uptime && date\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"top -b -n 1 | head -20\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"pidstat -u 1 3 | awk '$8 > 50 {print}'\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"ps auxf --sort=-%cpu | head -20\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"crictl ps --quiet | xargs -r crictl inspect --output=table - | grep -E '(cpu|memory)' || echo 'crictl not available; checking docker'\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"docker ps --format 'table {{.ID}}\\\\t{{.Names}}\\\\t{{.CPUPerc}}\\\\t{{.MemPerc}}' 2>/dev/null | head -15\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"PID=$(pidstat -u 1 1 | awk '$8 > 80 {print $4; exit}'); echo \\"Top offending PID: $PID\\"\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"if [ -n \\"$PID\\" ] && [ \\"$PID\\" -gt 0 ]; then cat /proc/$PID/cgroup 2>/dev/null | head -5; fi\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"if [ -n \\"$PID\\" ] && [ \\"$PID\\" -gt 0 ]; then ls -la /proc/$PID/exe 2>/dev/null; fi\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"if [ -n \\"$PID\\" ] && [ \\"$PID\\" -gt 0 ]; then renice -n 10 -p $PID 2>/dev/null && echo \\"Reniced PID $PID to +10\\"; fi\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"if [ -n \\"$PID\\" ] && [ \\"$PID\\" -gt 0 ]; then sleep 5; pidstat -u -p $PID 1 1; fi\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"kubectl get nodes workernode1hl -o jsonpath='{.status.conditions[?(@.type==\\"Ready\\")].status}' 2>/dev/null || echo 'kubectl not on node; check from control plane'\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.102 \\"kubect